  <section class="sdr-definition-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">The direct answer</div>
      <h2>What are outsourced SDR services?</h2>
      <p><strong>Outsourced SDR services give your company a managed sales development function without requiring you to recruit, train, equip, and manage the entire function internally.</strong></p>
      <p>An SDR is a sales development representative. The job is to create and qualify sales conversations before they reach the people responsible for discovery, proposals, negotiation, and closing.</p>
      <p>CallTeam can manage the operating work around that job: target-account preparation, prospect research, calling-led outreach, agreed follow-up channels, response handling, qualification, meeting scheduling, CRM workflow, reporting, and campaign improvement.</p>
      <div class="sdr-truth-line">You keep selling. We keep the front of the pipeline moving.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

